          "applies": true,
          "reason": "The scenario includes overpressure in EA-425A from quench water flashing to steam on the shell side (m:S-L-A-SIN:other_than:composition); the spring-operated PRV on EA-425A is designed for overpressure and would relieve pressure before tube failure."
        }
      ]
